  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to INSO (Protect workstream)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A civil society organisation will be selected through a call for proposals, to deliver against the &quot;Protect&quot; Pillar of the Humanitarian Strategic Framework, under the HEP programme. The aim will be to enable the protection of the people most at risk in conflict and crises, including women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
